         # and a flag_value set to something else. Refs:
         # https://github.com/pallets/click/issues/3024#issuecomment-3146199461
         # https://github.com/pallets/click/pull/3030/commits/06847da
+        #
+        # This aligned value is the literal value the flag resolves to, not a
+        # callable factory, even if it happens to be callable (e.g. a class
+        # used as a sentinel). Track that so get_default() knows not to call
